@GloriousSeal @WelcomingFrog continuing part 3...
menstruate.  Are they men or women?  They think like women, act like women, look like women, but lack internal female sex organs like a uterus.  And even if they were treated with testosterone, their bodies would not be able to respond to it at all.  In fact, it would be converted to estrogen.

There are also people that have undefined sex organs, male and female organs, various chromosomal combinations, etc.  So intersex people definitely exist!

